error[type.embed_place]: `embed` reads inside its own package — `../../outside.txt` names a file outside it
  ╭─[<case>/src/main.av:8:25]
8 │ const T: string = embed("../../outside.txt")
  ·                         ┬
  ·                         ╰── leaves the package here
──╯
help: keep the file in this package, or name a dependency's by its package — `embed("@scope/name/path")`
